{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>All that is given of it.</b> Here is masculine language regarding feminine, for example: <b>והרים ממנו בקומצו</b>; <b>יותן את הארץ הזאת</b>; ולא נשא אותם הארץ."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {0 "The three scriptural citations are adduced as examples of masculine agreement with feminine nouns; the second and third have no matching standard verses and are rendered hyper-literally as written."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:15:45.280952047Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}